# ==========================================================
#           Talk gateways
# ==========================================================
~ talk
[do! hide_all_sprite()].
- Ask her about her plans with Maya => talk_current_plan
- Ask her about her other plans => talk_other_plan
- Tell her something feels off [if EventFlag.instance.has_peak_inside_phone] => talk_something_off
- Ask her not to go anywhere today [if GameManager.loop_count > 0] => talk_dont_go
- Tell her that the day is looping [if GameManager.loop_count > 0] => talk_looping_day
- Nothing => END
=> END

~ talk_1
- Ask her about her plans with Maya => talk_current_plan
- Ask her about her other plans => talk_other_plan
- Nothing => END
=> END

~ talk_2
- Ask her about her plans with Maya => talk_current_plan
- Ask her about her other plans => talk_other_plan
- Ask her not to go anywhere today => talk_dont_go
- Tell her that the day is looping => talk_looping_day
- Nothing => END
=> END

~ talk_3
- Ask her about her plans with Maya => talk_current_plan
- Ask her about her other plans => talk_other_plan
- Tell her something feels off => talk_something_off
- Ask her not to go anywhere today => talk_dont_go
- Tell her that the day is looping => talk_looping_day
- Nothing => END
=> END

# ==========================================================
#           Talk branches
# ==========================================================
~ talk_current_plan
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")]So, where are you and Maya going today?
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]Hmm, I'm not sure yet. Maya said she'd figure it out.
Adrian: Oh, really? Is it somewhere far?
Elena: I don't think so. Probably somewhere around town.
Adrian: Alright.
=> talk

~ talk_other_plan
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")]Are you going anywhere else today, besides going out with Maya?
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]Hmm, I don't think so. Why?
Adrian: No reason. Just wondering.
Elena: Nope, that's the only plan I have today.
=> talk

~ talk_something_off
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")]Hey, Elena... can I ask you something?
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]Hmm? What is it?
Adrian: You and Maya have been friends for a long time, right?
Elena: Yeah. Since college, actually. Why?
Adrian: I was just wondering... has she always been this... attentive?
Elena: Maya? Yeah, I guess she has. She's always been like that.
Adrian: She checks on you a lot.
Elena: Haha, yeah. She worries about me too much sometimes.
Adrian: And she always seems to know what you're doing.
Elena: That's just Maya. She's always been curious about my life.
Adrian: Right...
Elena: Why are you asking all this?
Adrian: Nothing. I just noticed a few things.
Elena: Adrian, you're not worried about Maya, are you?
Adrian: I'm not sure yet.
Elena: What do you mean?
Adrian: I just feel like... maybe there's something about her we don't know.
Elena: You might be overthinking it.
Adrian: I hope so.
=> talk

~ talk_dont_go
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")]Elena, you're not going out today.
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_angry")]What? Why?
Adrian: Just... please. Stay home today.
Elena: Adrian, what's wrong with you?
Adrian: Something's going to happen to you if you leave.
Elena: What are you talking about?
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_angry")]You're going to get into an accident.
Elena: ...An accident?
Adrian: I know it sounds crazy, but you have to trust me.
Elena: How would you even know that?
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")]I just know. Please, Elena. Don't go today.
Elena: Adrian, you're scaring me. What happened?
Adrian: I can't explain it right now. Just... stay with me. Please.
Elena: You’re crazy.
=> talk

~ talk_looping_day
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_angry")]Elena, I need you to listen to me. I've been through this day before.
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]What?
Adrian: I've already lived through today. More than once.
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_angry")]Adrian... what are you talking about?
Adrian: Every time you leave the house, something happens. Then I wake up here again, at the same time, on the same morning.
Elena: You're saying... you're stuck in some kind of loop?
Adrian: Yes.
Elena: I'm sorry, but I don't believe you.
Adrian: I know it sounds crazy, but it's true.
Elena: Then prove it to me.
Adrian: ...I can.
Elena: How?
=> prove

# ==========================================================
#           Prove dialogues
# ==========================================================
~ prove
[do! hide_all_sprite()].
- About the present [if EventFlag.instance.has_found_present and not EventFlag.instance.is_present_proved] => prove_present
- About the incoming call [if EventFlag.instance.has_peak_inside_phone and not EventFlag.instance.is_call_proved] => prove_call
- About the diary [if EventFlag.instance.has_read_diary and not EventFlag.instance.is_diary_proved] => prove_diary
- About the doll [if EventFlag.instance.has_found_doll and not EventFlag.instance.is_doll_proved] => prove_doll
- Finish => prove_test
=> END

# See if proving is correct
~ prove_test
if EventFlag.instance.is_present_proved and EventFlag.instance.is_call_proved and EventFlag.instance.is_diary_proved and EventFlag.instance.is_doll_proved:
	=> prove_successful
else:
	=> prove_failed
=> END

~ prove_successful
Elena: Ugh... this is unbelievable. So we just have to wait for Maya to call?
Adrian: Yeah.
Elena: And then I'll know you're telling the truth?
Adrian: Exactly.
Elena: Alright... let's wait and see.
set EventFlag.instance.is_prove_successful = true
=> END

~ prove_failed
Elena: ...I don't know, Adrian. That doesn't really prove anything.
Adrian: I know...
Elena: Maybe you're just remembering things wrong.
Adrian: No, I'm sure I've been through this before.
Elena: Then you'll have to find a better way to prove it.
=> END

~ prove_present
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_angry") show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.CENTER, "gift")]I found this gift.
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]What? Where did you find that?
Adrian: I found it in our closet in the previous loop.
Elena: Previous loop?
Adrian: Yes. I've been through this day before, Elena. More than once.
set EventFlag.instance.is_present_proved = true
=> prove

~ prove_call
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_angry")]Maya's going to call you soon.
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]What? How do you know that?
Adrian: She called you in the previous loop. At first, she didn't ask you to bring me.
Elena: Then what happened?
Adrian: During the call, she'll ask you to bring me along.
Elena: ...You're saying you already know what she's going to say?
Adrian: Exactly. Just wait. You'll see.
set EventFlag.instance.is_call_proved = true
=> prove

~ prove_diary
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_angry") show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.CENTER, "diary")]Elena, I found something in your diary.
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]My diary? What did you find?
Adrian: You wrote about Maya.
Elena: ...What about her?
Adrian: You said she's been acting strange lately.
Elena: I... wrote that?
Adrian: Yeah. You even wrote that you weren't sure why, but something about her felt different.
Elena: I remember feeling that way... but I thought I was just overthinking it.
Adrian: You weren't. You felt it too, Elena.
set EventFlag.instance.is_diary_proved = true
=> prove

~ prove_doll
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_angry") show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.CENTER, "doll")]This plushie... Maya gave this to you, right?
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]Yeah. Why?
Adrian: I was just looking at it and... something feels weird.
Elena: Weird? What do you mean?
Adrian: There's something inside it.
Elena: What?
Adrian: Wait... Is that a camera?
Elena: A camera?! Why would there be a camera inside my plushie?
Adrian: I don't know. But someone put it there.
Elena: ...Maya gave me this.
Adrian: I know. That's why I'm asking you... are you sure she didn't put this here?
set EventFlag.instance.is_doll_proved = true
=> prove
